 trillion in 2030, as cited by fool.com. | quote: Nvidia rival AMD forecasts that sales of AI accelerator chips could hit $1 trillion in 2030.\", \"type\": \"choice\"}, \"q4\": {\"criteria\": {\"different\": \"a different fact, figure or matter, a figure for another period or quantity, or only a secondary statement of the stored piece, even if on the same topic\", \"same_statement\": \"the INCOMING PIECE reports the STORED PIECE's main statement: a retelling, another outlet carrying it, the same number in text or a table, or the same speaker repeating it; wording, precision and extra detail may differ. If the stored piece carries several statements and the incoming piece reports only a secondary one, this is not it\", \"supersedes\": \"a later version of the stored piece's main statement, changed: the same speaker revises that guidance, forecast or event-progress statement, an official confirms or denies that reported claim, or the original source revises it; another statement on the same topic is not this\"}, \"instructions\": \"How does the INCOMING PIECE relate to the STORED PIECE below? Use only the supplied text. STORED PIECE:\\nSTORED PIECE [party_statement; Manali Pradhan, fool.com; original source Nvidia, stated unknown] Nvidia CEO Jensen Huang said Nvidia expects revenue to grow about 70% in fiscal 2028, which begins January 31, 2027. Management said the forecast does not reflect the full scope of demand because it is constrained by limited supply of components for its AI platforms. | quote: He said Nvidia expects revenue to grow about 70% in its fiscal 2028, which begins Jan 31, 2027. But management says even that forecast doesn't reflect the full scope of demand for its offerings; it's constrained by the limited supply of components required to build its artificial intelligence (AI) platforms.\", \"type\": \"choice\"}, \"q5\": {\"criteria\": {\"different\": \"a different fact, figure or matter, a figure for another period or quantity, or only a secondary 